{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-p157b","title":"曹操马入麦田割发自刑","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-p157b-account","label":"《曹瞒传》","text":"《曹瞒传》记曹操禁践麦，自己的马腾入麦中，命议罪后割发自刑。","evidence":["wudi-e-p157b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"割发自刑","evidence":["wudi-e-p157b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"一次出军时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据所在段落机械补定年份。","evidence":["wudi-e-p157b-q"]},"source_order":[1,1137,"P157b"],"order":457}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-p157b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-b02c08a63c1f0172f907","layer":"pei","quote":"尝出军，行经麦中，令士卒：‘无败麦，犯者死！’骑士皆下马，付麦以相持。于是太祖马腾入麦中，敕主簿议罪。主簿对以《春秋》之义，罚不加于尊。太祖曰：‘制法而自犯之，何以帅下？然孤为军帅，不可自杀，请自刑。’因援剑割发以置地。","attribution":"《曹瞒传》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6c928ccff5d542bc3225","start":262,"end":372}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
